 bg-hairline lg:block"></div><div role="radiogroup" aria-label="Übungsrichtung" class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="relative inline-flex"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tipp-r97" class="btn-primary btn-toggle">Schreiben</button><span data-hinweis-anker="tipp-r97" hidden=""></span></span><span class="relative inline-flex"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" aria-describedby="tipp-r98" class="btn-secondary btn-toggle">Lesen</button><span data-hinweis-anker="tipp-r98" hidden=""></span></span></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="hidden h-11 w-px shrink-0 self-center bg-hairline lg:block"></div><label class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-ink"><span class="text-ink-muted">Schrift:</span><span class="relative inline-flex"><select aria-label="Brailleschriftsystem (Bereich) auswählen" aria-describedby="tipp-r99" class="min-w-0 max-w-[14rem] rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink focus:border-accent"><option value="basis">Basisschrift</option><option value="voll">Vollschrift</option><option value="computer">Computer</option><option value="kurzschrift">Kurzschrift</option><option value="ueb">UEB (Englisch)</option></select><span data-hinweis-anker="tipp-r99" hidden=""></span></span></label><div aria-hidden="true" class="hidden h-11 w-px shrink-0 self-center bg-hairline lg:block"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1"><span class="relative inline-flex"><button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-toggle" aria-disabled="true" aria-label="Vorige Etappe" aria-describedby="tipp-r9a"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span></button><span data-hinweis-anker="tipp-r9a" hidden=""></span></span><span class="relative inline-flex"><select aria-label="Kapitel (Etappe) auswählen — mit Pfeil rauf und runter blättern" aria-describedby="tipp-r9b" class="order-first w-full max-w-[18rem] rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink focus:border-accent sm:order-none sm:w-auto"><option value="0">Etappe 1: Getting started: capitals, numbers, punctuation</option><option value="1">Etappe 2: Lesson 4: Alphabetic Wordsigns</option><option value="2">Etappe 3: Lesson 5: Strong Wordsigns: and, for, of, the, with</option><option value="3">Etappe 4: Lesson 6: Strong Groupsigns: and, for, of, the, with</option><option value="4">Etappe 5: Lesson 7: ch, gh, sh, th, wh (+ Wordsigns child, shall, this, which)</option><option value="5">Etappe 6: Lesson 8: ed, er, ou, ow (+ Wordsign out)</option><option value="6">Etappe 7: Lesson 9: st, ar, ing (+ Wordsign still)</option><option value="7">Etappe 8: Lesson 10: be, con, dis; Shortforms</option><option value="8">Etappe 9: Lesson 11: ea, bb, cc, ff, gg</option><option value="9">Etappe 10: Lesson 12: en, in; Lower Sign Rule</option><option value="10">Etappe 11: Lesson 13: Lower Wordsigns: be, his, was, were, enough, in; Shortforms</option><option value="11">Etappe 12: Lesson 14: Summary of Lower Signs; Shortforms</option><option value="12">Etappe 13: Lesson 15: Dot 5 initial-letter contractions D–M; Shortforms</option><option value="13">Etappe 14: Lesson 16: Dot 5 initial-letter contractions N–U; Shortforms</option><option value="14">Etappe 15: Lesson 17: Dot 5 initial-letter contractions (rest); Shortforms</option><option value="15">Etappe 16: Lesson 18: Dots 4-5: upon, word, these, those, whose</option><option value="16">Etappe 17: Lesson 19: Dots 4-5-6: cannot, had, many, spirit, world, their</option><option value="17">Etappe 18: Lesson 20: Final-letter groupsigns: ance, ence, sion, tion, less, ness</option><option value="18">Etappe 19: Lesson 21: Final-letter groupsigns: ound, ong, ount, ment</option><option value="19">Etappe 20: Lesson 22: Final-letter groupsigns: ful, ity</option></select><span data-hinweis-anker="tipp-r9b" hidden=""></span></span><span class="relative inline-flex"><button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-toggle" aria-label="Nächste Etappe" aria-describedby="tipp-r9c"><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><span data-hinweis-anker="tipp-r9c" hidden=""></span></span></div></div></div><div class="space-y-4"><details class="blatt-karte rounded-xl border border-accent/30 bg-accent-soft p-3" open=""><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Diese Kürzungen üben wir hier: <span class="font-normal text-ink-soft">A · 1 · . · , · ? · !</span></summary><p class="mb-3 mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Before the contractions, two little signs you meet everywhere: a dot-six sign in front of a letter makes it a CAPITAL, and the number sign goes in front of digits. Add the full stop, comma, question mark and exclamation mark and you are ready. You already read braille letters and numbers — this is just what English puts on top.</p><ul tabindex="-1" aria-label="Meine Tasten: Kürzungen dieser Welt" class="m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-3 p-0 outline-none"><li class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface-sunken px-3 py-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">A</span><span class="text-xs text-ink-muted">…</span></div><span class="sr-only">A</span></li><li class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface-sunken px-3 py-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">1</span><span class="text-xs text-ink-muted">…</span></div><span class="sr-only">1</span></li><li class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface-sunken px-3 py-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">.</span><span class="text-xs text-ink-muted">…</span></div><span class="sr-only">.</span></li><li class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface-sunken px-3 py-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">,</span><span class="text-xs text-ink-muted">…</span></div><span class="sr-only">,</span></li><li class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface-sunken px-3 py-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">?</span><span class="text-xs text-ink-muted">…</span></div><span class="sr-only">?</span></li><li class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface-sunken px-3 py-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">!</span><span class="text-xs text-ink-muted">…</span></div><span class="sr-only">!</span></li></ul></details><div class="space-y-2" data-aufgabe="schreiben-Mia"><p id=":r9e:" class="m-0 text-center text-sm text-ink-muted">Schreib in Braille:</p><div class="card rounded-2xl focus-within:ring-[4.5px] focus-within:ring-accent"><div class="relative px-4 py-3"><p class="m-0 text-center font-bold tracking-wide text-ink" style="font-size: 1.8rem; line-height: 1.1;" data-angabe="true" aria-describedby=":r9e:">Mia</p><div class="mt-2 flex justify-center sm:absolute sm:right-3 sm:top-1/2 sm:mt-0 sm:-translate-y-1/2 sm:justify-end"><span class="relative inline-flex"><div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-0.5"><div id="pl-round-ticks" role="img" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Runde: 0 von mindestens 12 Aufgaben geschafft, noch mindestens 12." aria-describedby="tipp-r9f" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5 rounded-lg px-1 outline-none focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:ring-[4.5px] focus-visible:ring-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="tt-ticks"><span class="tt-tick"></span><span class="tt-tick"></span><span class="tt-tick"></span><span class="tt-tick"></span><span class="tt-tick"></span><span class="tt-tick"></span><span class="tt-tick"></span><span class="tt-tick"></span><span class="tt-tick"></span><span class="tt-tick"></span><span class="tt-tick"></span><span class="tt-tick"></span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] font-medium text-ink-muted"><span class="font-semibold text-ink">0/12</span><span class="uppercase tracking-wide">Runde</span></span></div></div><span data-hinweis-anker="tipp-r9f" hidden=""></span></span></div></div><p id=":r9d:" class="sr-only">Punkt-Tasten f d s und j k l gleichzeitig drücken und loslassen ergibt eine Zelle. Sitzt die Zelle, geht es von selbst weiter. Leertaste für die Lücke, Rücktaste löscht. Umschalt gedrückt halten sagt die nächste Zelle an.</p><div data-schreibflaeche="true" class="relative border-t border-hairline px-4 pb-4 pt-3 outline-none"><textarea class="sr-only" rows="1" wrap="off" aria-label="Braille-Eingabefeld" aria-describedby=":r9d:" aria-keyshortcuts="Backspace Space Shift" tabindex="0" data-feld="braillezellen" data-kuerzel="an" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" autocorrect="off">Mia   ⡀⡀⡀⡀</textarea><div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-center gap-1.5"><div data-zelle="aktuell" class="rounded-lg p-1 transition-colors bg-accent-soft ring-1 ring-accent/50"><svg role="img" aria-label="aktuelle Zelle" data-zustand="pending" viewBox="0 0 60 90" width="26.666666666666664" height="40"><circle cx="18" cy="15" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="45" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="75" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="15" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="45" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="75" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle></svg></div><div class="rounded-lg p-1 transition-colors "><svg role="img" aria-label="leere Zelle" data-zustand="neutral" viewBox="0 0 60 90" width="26.666666666666664" height="40"><circle cx="18" cy="15" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="45" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="75" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="15" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="45" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="75" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle></svg></div><div class="rounded-lg p-1 transition-colors "><svg role="img" aria-label="leere Zelle" data-zustand="neutral" viewBox="0 0 60 90" width="26.666666666666664" height="40"><circle cx="18" cy="15" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="45" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="75" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="15" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="45" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="75" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle></svg></div><div class="rounded-lg p-1 transition-colors "><svg role="img" aria-label="leere Zelle" data-zustand="neutral" viewBox="0 0 60 90" width="26.666666666666664" height="40"><circle cx="18" cy="15" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="45" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="75" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="15" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="45" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="75" r="8.5" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.7"></circle></svg></div></div></div></div><p class="text-center text-sm text-ink-muted">Tasten: <kbd>f</kbd>=1 <kbd>d</kbd>=2 <kbd>s</kbd>=3 · <kbd>j</kbd>=4 <kbd>k</kbd>=5 <kbd>l</kbd>=6 — gleichzeitig drücken, dann loslassen. Sitzt die Zelle, geht es von selbst weiter. <kbd>Leertaste</kbd> = Lücke zwischen Wörtern, <kbd>⌫</kbd> = letzte Zelle löschen.</p></div></div></div></div></div><footer aria-label="Rechtliches" class="mt-10 text-center text-xs text-ink-muted"><a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/datenschutz">Datenschutz</a> · <a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/impressum">Impressum</a> · <a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/unterstuetzen">Unterstützen</a></footer></div>"`;

